        },
        {
          "id": "d-410c06ede77fb6c4/b07_0006",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Supplementary materials are available at Open Forum Infectious Diseases online. Consisting of data provided by the authors to benefit the reader, the posted materials are not copyedited and are the sole responsibility of the authors, so questions or comments should be addressed to the corresponding author.",
          "bbox": {
