            "y1": 97.53923689631358
          },
          "page": 8,
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "font_size": null,
          "bold": null,
          "source": "docling",
          "ocr_engine": null
        },
        {
          "id": "d-410c06ede77fb6c4/b08_0001",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Patient consent statement. DRIVE-FORWARD, DRIVE-AHEAD, and DRIVE-SHIFT trials were conducted in conformance with International Council for Harmonisation Guidelines for Good Clinical Practice and applicable regulations regarding the protection of human participants in biomedical research. The protocols were approved by the independent ethics committee  for  each  study  site,  and  all  participants  provided  written  informed consent before any study procedures were performed. No additional data were collected for the current post hoc analysis.",
          "bbox": {
            "x0": 48.982799919999984,
            "y0": 100.35311534000004,
            "x1": 289.84058916000004,
            "y1": 177.5326369663136
          },
          "page": 8,
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "font_size": null,
          "bold": null,
          "source": "docling",
          "ocr_engine": null
        },
        {
