        {
          "id": "d-410c06ede77fb6c4/b08_0003",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Potential conflicts of interest. K.S., Z.J.X., W.G., R.M.P., and Y.W. are current or former employees of Merck Sharp & Dohme LLC, a subsidiary of Merck & Co., Inc., Rahway, NJ, USA, who may own stock and/or hold stock options in Merck & Co., Inc., Rahway, NJ, USA. R.L. is an employee of MSD France, Puteaux, France, and may own stock and/or hold stock options in Merck & Co., Inc., Rahway, NJ, USA. S.L.W. has received consulting fees from MSD, ViiV Healthcare, GSK and Gilead Sciences; honoraria from  Merck  &  Co.,  Inc.,  Rahway,  NJ,  USA,  ViiV  Healthcare,  GSK  and Gilead  Sciences;  and  research  grants  paid  to  her  institution  from  Merck & Co., Inc., Rahway, NJ, USA, Gilead Sciences, ViiV Healthcare, Janssen and  GSK.  P.N.K.  has  received  research  grants  paid  to  her  institution from Gilead Sciences, ViiV Healthcare, GSK, Merck & Co., Inc., Rahway, NJ,  USA,  and  Theratechnologies;  received  advisory  board  fees  from Gilead  Sciences,  ViiV  Healthcare,  GSK,  and  Merck;  and  own  stock  or hold stock options in Gilead Sciences, ViiV Healthcare, GSK, Theratechnologies, Merck & Co., Inc., Rahway, NJ, USA, Pfizer, Johnson &  Johnson,  and  Moderna.  C.O.  has  received  honoraria  from  Janssen, Gilead  Sciences,  ViiV  Healthcare,  MSD,  and  Bavarian  Nordic;  received support for attending  meetings and/or travel from  Janssen, Gilead Sciences,  ViiV  Healthcare,  MSD,  and  Bavarian  Nordic;  advisory  board fees from Janssen, Gilead Sciences, ViiV Healthcare, MSD, and Bavarian Nordic; and research grants paid to her institution from Janssen, Gilead Sciences, ViiV Healthcare, MSD, and AstraZeneca. M.T. is a member of the IAS-USA  Antiretroviral Guidelines Panel and co-chair of the HIVMA/IDSA HIV Primary Care Guidance Panel; has received personal fees  to  serve  as  Independent  Data  Monitoring  Committee  chair  from Excision Biotherapeutics; and has received research support paid to her institution from Merck & Co., Inc., Rahway, NJ, USA.",
          "bbox": {
